<title>USA: Conversion, Octagon merger pact.</title>
<headline>Conversion, Octagon merger pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conversion Technologies International Inc and Octagon Inc said in a joint statement on Tuesday they entered into a definitive merger agreement.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the proposed merger, which is expected to close in the first calendar quarter of 1997 and is subject to customary conditions, holders of Octagon common stock will receive one share of Conversion Technologies common stock for every 10 shares of Octagon common stock. Octagon will become a wholly-owned subsidiary of Conversion.</p>
<p>Conversion is an early-stage advanced materials company. Octagon is a technical services firm.</p>
</text>
